WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.870
<b>Strange Events in Loveland City</b>

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.870
<b>Why Are People Falling Asleep and Not Waking?</b>

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:01.900
<i>Beginning last weekend,</i>

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:06.180
<i>many people have fallen into a deep sleep 
from which they do not wake.</i>

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:09.150
<i>A large number of these cases have
 been confirmed in Loveland City.</i>

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:11.600
<i>According to the Loveland Cognitive
 Psychological Association,</i>

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>the comatose patients' vitals are stable,</i>

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:16.900
<i>and their lives are not at risk.</i>

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.870
<i>No abnormalites have been 
found in their brain waves.</i>

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:21.870
<b>Strange Events in Loveland City</b>

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:21.870
<b>Why Are People Falling Asleep and Not Waking?</b>

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:22.430
<i>It is being theorized that they are 
simply in a continuous dream state.</i>

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:25.620
We have appointments with 
several overseas research labs.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:27.560
We've already sent the data,

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.960
so once it's been reviewed, 
it will be examined.

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:33.720
We've begun investment reviews 
of relevant companies.

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:35.860
Once they've received funding,

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:38.370
we'll establish a specialized 
development team.

00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:42.050
Please continue inquiries along those lines.

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:45.380
I will reach out to the Cognitive 
Psychology Association myself.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:47.730
Proceed with Plan C.

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:48.580
Yes, sir!

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:52.980
This project has great 
significance for society!

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:56.570
Our CEO himself is taking personal command!

00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:57.620
Let's give it our all!

00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:59.080
Yes, sir!

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:00.950
Understood.

00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:01.620
We'll do everything we can, too.

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:03.410
<b>Strange Events in Loveland City</b>

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:03.410
<b>Why Are People Falling Asleep and Not Waking?</b>

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:03.040
What happened to those files?

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:14.840
<i>We bring the flavor of coffee to life.</i>

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>Our hand-picked beans
 produce a complex flavor.</i>

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:18.300
<i>By destroying the electromagnetic 
wave transmitter at Loveland TV Tower,</i>

00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:20.430
<i>Enjoy a moment of refinement in one cup.</i>

00:01:18.690 --> 00:01:22.560
<i>we were able to stop Evols 
from going berserk everywhere.</i>

00:01:20.990 --> 00:01:23.000
<i>The new Major Coffee is on sale now!</i>

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:24.310
<b>Guide Robots Gone Berserk at Loveland TV Tower?
 No Casualties.</b>

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:23.840
But...

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:30.850
<i>Kiro... You're okay, right?</i>

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:33.580
<i>You wouldn't let them take you 
down that easily, right?</i>

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:35.240
<i>You're a hero, after all.</i>

00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:39.660
<i>All communication is still cut off.</i>

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:43.660
<i>Nothing from Kiro, Victor, or Gavin...</i>

00:01:48.910 --> 00:01:49.950
Gavin!

00:01:49.950 --> 00:01:51.360
What happened?

00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:53.340
You're hurt...

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:57.420
You don't need to worry about anything.

00:01:58.090 --> 00:02:00.280
I have some things I need to take care of.

00:02:00.710 --> 00:02:03.930
Once I have... I promise I'll come back.

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:07.350
<i>Papa...</i>

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:11.190
<i>Is there anything I can do to help everyone?</i>

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:18.070
<i>Further news on the spreading 
cases of sleeping syndrome.</i>

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:22.510
<i>The number of people who have fallen 
into a comatose state continues to rise.</i>

00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:25.530
<i>A fear of sleeping has been observed 
in a portion of the populace.</i>

00:02:25.530 --> 00:02:28.540
<i>In response, the Cognitive Psychology 
Association says that excessive...</i>

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:36.680
<i>Nothing is over yet.</i>

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:39.860
<i>It's more like this is the real beginning.</i>

00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:42.390
<i>There's something inside me telling me so.</i>

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:44.810
<i>I'll never let you destroy</i>

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:48.890
<i>this world everyone has been so 
deeply wounded to protect. No more!</i>

00:02:51.810 --> 00:03:00.240
"It takes all the running you can do, 
to keep in the same place."

00:02:51.810 --> 00:03:00.240
~The Red Queen Hypothesis~

00:03:01.630 --> 00:03:02.920
<i>"Queen."</i>

00:03:02.920 --> 00:03:04.700
<i>The one who possesses her genes</i>

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:07.320
<i>can bless those who have 
special powers, Evolvers,</i>

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:10.600
<i>with even greater power, 
clearing a path to the future.</i>

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:12.770
<i>When the Queen truly awakens,</i>

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:16.210
<i>will the world achieve further evolution, or...</i>

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:36.000
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:39.620
"At the Edge of the Coming Time"

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:41.330
<i>We immediately began researching 
the sleeping syndrome</i>

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:43.050
<i>spreading throughout the city.</i>

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:45.720
<i>The cause is still unknown.</i>

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:48.390
<i>A countermeasures task force 
transfers the sleeping patients</i>

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:50.140
<i>to the Cognitive Science Association.</i>

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:53.000
<i>While they are observed and tested,</i>

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:57.270
<i>they are supplied with nutrients 
that serve as life support.</i>

00:04:57.790 --> 00:05:01.550
<i>One unusual characteristic is that 
most of those who remain asleep</i>

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:04.360
<i>are young people, in their teens to thirties.</i>

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:08.280
This really isn't normal, is it?

00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:12.680
The Cognitive Psychology Association 
is looking into a lot of things, too,

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:15.500
but they say not a single 
person has woken up yet.

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:18.830
Maybe they're having really nice dreams?

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:21.090
Take a look at this.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:29.720
Miracle Entertainment

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:24.690
It's eyewitness testimony from 
the families of the sleeping people.

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:27.560
Some of the ones who have 
fallen into the deepest sleep

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:30.340
have been showing unbelievable symptoms.

00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:32.110
Like things suddenly catching fire,

00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:34.930
or parts of their bodies freezing solid,

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:37.710
or nearby electronic devices shorting out...

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:39.190
What's that supposed to mean?

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:42.110
I'm going to the Cognitive
 Psychology Association.

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:44.190
Be careful, okay?

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:49.580
<i>If all this chaos is being caused by Black Swan,</i>

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:50.810
<i>then is Lucien also...</i>

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:04.070
Victor?

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:07.140
What have you been doing all this time? 
I've been trying to get in touch—

00:06:07.140 --> 00:06:08.200
Get in.

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:10.730
You're going to the Cognitive 
Psychology Association, right?

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:15.560
In general, it is just as you have theorized.

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:19.350
Black Swan is using sleeping gas 
to send people into a deep slumber.

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:22.830
Then, by using some method to monitor 
the depths of their consciousness,

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:24.820
they are attempting to awaken Evols.

00:06:25.210 --> 00:06:27.060
Is that even possible?

00:06:27.060 --> 00:06:29.290
Logically, it is a possibility.

00:06:29.650 --> 00:06:33.080
One's state of mind is deeply connected 
to the manifestation of Evol.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:36.580
The things depicted in dreams—memories, scenes,

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:38.310
internal desires...

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:40.030
Providing a strong stimulus

00:06:40.030 --> 00:06:43.290
calls these forth, awakening 
the powers within the dreamer.

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:45.240
That's...

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:52.400
The Cognitive Psychology 
Association is well-established,

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:57.260
but currently, the majority of them are 
involved in research tainted by Black Swan.

00:06:58.010 --> 00:07:01.110
There's a diagram of the Association 
building's layout in the dashboard.

00:07:01.110 --> 00:07:02.810
Review it until we arrive.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:07.280
This really covers everything.

00:07:07.980 --> 00:07:12.870
How long has LFG's great CEO 
been working as a detective?

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:17.160
Well, I knew you'ld charge straight 
into wherever things were happening.

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:20.130
It's faster if I provide 
follow-up support for you,

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:21.730
and above all, it's safer.

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:23.250
What is it?

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.420
It's just... you're not stopping me.

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:27.110
Usually, it'd be,

00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:30.890
"What's an idiot like you going to 
accomplish by charging in there?"

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:33.380
You'd get angry and say 
something mean, you know?

00:07:33.380 --> 00:07:35.020
You want me to get angry?

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:36.100
No, but...

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:40.270
It's throwing me off...

00:07:44.070 --> 00:07:46.400
Where have you been all this time?

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:50.720
Mr. Mills and everyone 
at LFG was really worried.

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:52.620
I went to see the future.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:54.740
Wh-What do you mean?

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:57.790
When my Evol went out of control,
I fell into a wormhole,

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:01.060
a border zone between here 
and a different space-time.

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:03.400
What I saw in that space was a world

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:07.040
corresponding to roughly ten years 
from this point in space-time.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:11.070
At first, I was somewhat confused, 
but it isn't an issue anymore.

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:13.150
It's a huge issue!

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:15.530
To think you could do something like that...

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:17.350
The world of the future...

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:20.220
What is our future like?

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:22.870
These incidents... They wouldn't have caused...

00:08:23.660 --> 00:08:24.740
It is peaceful.

00:08:25.530 --> 00:08:29.270
It prospers as if nothing ever happened, 
and the people live happily.

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:33.000
There was no information on 
comatose victims or Evol at all.

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:35.940
It must have been resolved in the early stages.

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:38.160
You were doing well, too.

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:43.990
You were so busy that even I needed 
an appointment three days in advance.

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:47.010
Future me is doing that well?

00:08:47.010 --> 00:08:51.450
And this successful person actually 
spoke with me over a meal at Souvenir.

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:52.680
Would you like to hear

00:08:52.680 --> 00:08:55.340
about how she asked Mr. Mills 
for an extra large pasta and—

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:57.870
That's enough! That's more than enough!

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:59.230
I see...

00:08:59.690 --> 00:09:02.010
The future continues on from here.

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:12.170
Cognitive Psychology Association

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:31.040
<i>Victor's thorough preparatory investigations</i>

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:36.080
<i>made it possible for us to obtain 
detailed data on Black Swan's plans.</i>

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:40.560
<i>The special sleeping gas 
dispersed throughout Loveland City</i>

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:42.930
<i>only affects those who aren't Evolvers,</i>

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:45.490
Hey, what's wrong? Hey...

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:44.980
<i>sending them into a deep sleep.</i>

00:09:45.910 --> 00:09:48.360
<i>With their consciousness stolen, 
their brains are disrupted</i>

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:51.800
<i>by an electromagnetic wave 
with a specific pulse frequency,</i>

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:55.160
<i>which gives them dreams and 
encourages their Evols to awaken.</i>

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:59.240
<i>However, the probability that the Evol 
they manifest in their dreams will be</i>

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:01.450
<i>compatible with their 
bodies is extremely low.</i>

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:05.410
<i>The people who are unable 
to awaken as Evolvers...</i>

00:10:07.570 --> 00:10:11.590
"Survival rate... 0.01 percent"?

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:16.380
Most of these people are unable to 
become Evolvers, and will eventually die.

00:10:17.570 --> 00:10:20.430
<i>Those who cannot adapt to the new world</i>

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:23.030
<i>have no choice but to perish 
as the vanquished.</i>

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:27.050
This is what Hades was talking about.

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:31.590
<i>Intruders detected in the 
research building west wing.</i>

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:33.730
<i>All sections, commence countermeasures.</i>

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:35.730
Let's go.

00:11:02.230 --> 00:11:06.810
...givable. What they're 
doing is unforgivable!

00:11:09.470 --> 00:11:11.580
Hey! Who's out there?!

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:21.850
There's still no known way to 
wake those people up, is there?

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:23.910
Multiple companies are developing

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:26.700
devices that disrupt brain 
waves to stimulate waking.

00:11:27.150 --> 00:11:32.240
But no one has successfully escaped 
from Black Swan's "dreams" yet.

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:37.090
We can't let there be any more 
victims. We have to stop them!

00:11:37.890 --> 00:11:39.090
Yes.

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:46.640
Evolvers...

00:11:58.160 --> 00:12:01.030
It is pointless to resist any further.

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:04.650
We will take up the fight against Black Swan.

00:12:04.650 --> 00:12:07.870
Currently, they are a presence 
that disrupts world order.

00:12:09.550 --> 00:12:13.240
It is still too early for the 
world to learn of Evolvers.

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:16.790
They will only bring 
confusion and destruction.

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:20.760
So you kill them? No one has that right.

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:24.730
Your Evol has already 
far surpassed its limits.

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:27.970
The trigger must have been 
those electromagnetic waves...

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:33.040
But after losing your conviction and 
learning how powerless you are,

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:35.440
you have no strength left in you.

00:12:35.890 --> 00:12:37.890
Rest easy.

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:42.450
We will protect the peace 
and order of this world.

00:12:43.310 --> 00:12:44.920
You're wrong.

00:12:46.410 --> 00:12:50.990
Our bullets are only fired...

00:12:50.990 --> 00:12:52.250
to protect people!

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:18.950
Wait for me...

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:36.000
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:41.000
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:13:43.980 --> 00:13:47.700
<i>In that world, she no longer existed.</i>

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:51.030
<i>My Evol going out of control 
allowed me a glimpse</i>

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:53.530
<i>of a possible world ten years in the future.</i>

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:54.250
Loveland 
Super 
Expo
 2030

00:13:53.530 --> 00:13:55.500
<i>In that world, where humanity lived</i>

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:59.740
<i>in peace and prosperity as if nothing 
had happened, there was one thing...</i>

00:13:59.740 --> 00:14:01.360
<i>Her existence, and hers alone,</i>

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:03.430
<i>had been erased, as though 
it were wiped away.</i>

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:09.100
<i>It was as if she had never 
been born to begin with.</i>

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:22.040
<i>After that, I learned how 
to control my rampaging Evol</i>

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:24.160
<i>and peered into countless 
different space-times,</i>

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:26.510
<i>searching for a singularity.</i>

00:14:26.970 --> 00:14:28.980
<i>What happened to the world?</i>

00:14:28.980 --> 00:14:31.470
<i>How did we lose her?</i>

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:33.570
<i>Over and over again...</i>

00:14:52.190 --> 00:14:56.900
<i>I told myself, "This time, I'll find 
a future where we don't lose her."</i>

00:14:57.600 --> 00:14:59.380
<i>But she...</i>

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:04.710
Don't!

00:15:07.270 --> 00:15:09.970
<i>Every time it repeated, 
it forced me to realize...</i>

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:15.090
<i>You rise up again and again, 
pushing forward without giving up,</i>

00:15:15.090 --> 00:15:19.270
<i>fighting to protect everyone, 
getting hurt, and sacrificing yourself.</i>

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:21.650
<i>If that is who you are, then...</i>

00:15:23.990 --> 00:15:26.940
<i>I've decided that I will fight at your side,</i>

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:29.350
<i>that I will change fate with you.</i>

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:41.320
The Evolvers are...

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:42.120
Let's go!

00:15:42.570 --> 00:15:45.500
What about me? Why can I move?

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:47.250
A lot has happened.

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:50.530
Would you rather be frozen back there?

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:51.880
N-No, but...

00:15:52.740 --> 00:15:56.110
Not only can you stop time for Evolvers now,

00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:58.890
but you can choose who you stop at will?

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:01.050
This is just a theory,

00:16:01.050 --> 00:16:03.650
but it seems Evols evolve 
according to experience.

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:05.390
Evolve?

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:07.270
But that's unfair, isn't it?

00:16:07.880 --> 00:16:09.790
It isn't boundless.

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:13.090
There are limits.

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:26.920
Hades.

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:33.140
The clock hand of evolution has 
begun to move. None can stop it.

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:39.360
Everything that has happened 
in Loveland City up to this point

00:16:39.360 --> 00:16:41.270
has been no more than 
preliminary experiments.

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:46.810
The electromagnetic waves we're broadcasting 
will soon spread over the entire globe,

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:50.300
leading all people into a dream of evolution.

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:55.400
We've utilized the Queen's genes, 
which can cause Evols to evolve.

00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:58.040
The data from your unique 
brain waves allowed us

00:16:58.040 --> 00:17:01.150
to create electromagnetic 
waves of awakening,

00:17:01.150 --> 00:17:04.890
which will screen the human 
race and lead us to evolution.

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:07.320
Queen...

00:17:07.320 --> 00:17:10.500
You are the one who will cull the human race.

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:17.280
Originally, the prototype for this system 
was meant to help awaken you as Queen,

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:19.600
created for that purpose by Ares.

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:23.350
Though... it seems he has failed.

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:35.240
I will never

00:17:38.300 --> 00:17:39.710
lose to you!

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:59.080
Then I'll be waiting.

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:02.770
For you, Queen who never 
stops moving forward,

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:05.840
at the end of this path you tread.

00:18:07.320 --> 00:18:10.470
Was that... me?

00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:11.270
Yes.

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:14.140
That is your true power.

00:18:14.770 --> 00:18:18.500
The power of the Queen, which is 
near completing its awakening.

00:18:19.510 --> 00:18:21.190
Don't let them get away.

00:18:21.190 --> 00:18:23.760
Capture them and bring them 
back within the facility.

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:25.030
Tell those stationed outside—

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:28.240
This is my order to you.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:33.130
Nothing has happened here.

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:34.880
No one has broken into the facility.

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:39.120
Return to your posts and 
continue your usual duties.

00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:54.610
Just as my Evol evolved,

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:59.030
your Evol must have started 
to gain new powers, as well.

00:18:59.720 --> 00:19:01.580
Only the Queen can show us

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:06.490
Why Are People Falling Asleep and Not Waking?

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:03.940
the future that awaits us after evolution.

00:19:03.940 --> 00:19:06.490
This power is meant to manifest that.

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:10.910
Faced with that light,

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:13.910
there is no way the darkness 
Hades wields could win.

00:19:18.430 --> 00:19:22.930
If I use my power, I can defeat Hades.

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:28.850
Before, someone told me

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:33.190
that it was Black Swan who was in the wrong 
for trying to use the Queen's powers,

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:34.940
that it wasn't my fault.

00:19:35.410 --> 00:19:39.100
In that moment... honestly, 
I felt like I'd been saved.

00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:43.920
But now, I feel like it's not quite right.

00:19:44.350 --> 00:19:47.910
It's true that this situation 
was caused by Black Swan.

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:51.960
But it isn't as though 
I have nothing to do with it.

00:19:52.850 --> 00:19:57.000
If my powers as Queen put everyone in danger,

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:00.970
then I have to put an end to this 
with my own two hands.

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:04.860
I'm certain that's why my powers exist.

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:07.100
I'll stop Hades,

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:11.460
and I'll make that wonderful 
future you saw a reality.

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:13.410
Don't worry!

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:18.190
Compared to LFG's business 
meetings, Hades isn't scary at all!

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:20.320
True.

00:20:21.050 --> 00:20:25.360
You have overcome every ordeal 
I've put you through, after all.

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:29.790
Thank you for taking the
trouble to see me home.

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:47.230
What is it? Did you see something?

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:50.270
I know where Hades is.

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:56.880
<b>The key to the truth is in your hands.</b>

00:20:54.220 --> 00:20:55.280
<i>Lucien...</i>

00:20:59.450 --> 00:21:03.570
<i>Even when it calls for so many 
people to be sacrificed,</i>

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:06.450
<i>do you still wish for the world's evolution?</i>

00:22:48.690 --> 00:22:50.640
Are you certain about this?

00:22:51.010 --> 00:22:55.600
That thing has never once proved 
itself useful to me in any way.

00:22:56.070 --> 00:22:59.140
With this, its birth finally 
has some meaning.

00:22:59.950 --> 00:23:02.610
And this is something it 
has chosen for itself...

00:23:02.610 --> 00:23:06.570
The power to realize the world it desires.

00:23:12.340 --> 00:23:13.560
<i>Wait for me!</i>

00:23:20.930 --> 00:23:23.670
<i>You should take the path you believe in.</i>

00:23:23.670 --> 00:23:25.710
<i>You can do it, Potato Chip Princess!</i>

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:28.090
<i>Your power is more than that.</i>

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:30.610
<i>I will gamble everything on your future.</i>

00:23:30.610 --> 00:23:31.880
<i>Episode twelve...</i>

00:23:31.880 --> 00:23:33.240
<i>"Bonds."</i>

00:23:31.880 --> 00:23:34.970
"Bonds"
